            "evidence": "`LOAD_FAST_BORROW` and `LOAD_FAST_BORROW_LOAD_FAST_BORROW` use `dis.opmap[...]` whenever `sys.version_info[:2] >= (3, 14)`, while the subsequent filtering only handles `None` values. Thus the filter is never reached if an opcode is unavailable.",
